No active exploitation is known.

### Impact

Applications that enable ICC conversion while processing attacker-supplied
images can be made to terminate through memory corruption in the reproduced
LUT16 CLUT/output-LUT path. This report is limited to output-channel counts
greater than four in that path; it does not claim a TRC issue or other
unreproduced ICC paths.


